	shorttitle = {Zwischen traditionellem Schulbuch und hybridem Lehrmittel},
	abstract = {The use of digital media is becoming increasingly important in the school context. Learning as well as teaching about and with digital media is demanded. However, the realization not only involves opportunities, but also technological and organizational challenges. This is where the contribution starts: Using the example of a hybrid French textbook, in which digital media are integral element of the textbook, the practices and experiences are examined during the first year of implementation. The perspectives of the school leader, teachers and pupils are surveyed and the associated opportunities and challenges for learning and teaching with digital media are highlighted and discussed.},
